flowchart TD
    UI[React Vite Workspace] --> API[FastAPI REST API]
    API --> LG[LangGraph StateGraph]
    LG --> VAL[Input Validation]
    VAL -->|valid| PIPE[Specialist Agent Pipeline]
    VAL -->|invalid| FIN[Finalize]
    PIPE --> PROF[Profiler and Planner]
    PROF --> SEC[Security Guardian]
    SEC --> DATA[EDA and Statistics]
    DATA --> PRE[Preprocessing]
    PRE --> ML[ML Agent: sklearn and optional PyTorch]
    ML --> CRIT[Critic and bounded Replanner]
    CRIT --> EX[Explainability]
    EX --> RES[Research Agent: local RAG and optional Crossref]
    RES --> REP[Reporting Agent: deterministic plus optional LLM]
    REP --> FIN
    FIN --> STORE[(SQLite History and Research Index)]
    FIN --> ART[Local Model Artifacts]
    API --> MCP[MCP stdio server]
    PIPE --> ENGINE[Pandas / optional DuckDB]
    PIPE --> TRACK[Optional MLflow]
